# Task 15 Task 12 (spec section 20): reference Caddy reverse-proxy config
# for a LinuxLab Node classroom deployment. Caddy is the Phase 1 reference
# reverse proxy (ADR-008); Gunicorn is never exposed directly to the
# classroom LAN.
#
# Node classroom traffic may be HTTP or HTTPS depending on local
# infrastructure. This example uses a bare port (plain HTTP, no automatic
# TLS) for a LAN with no local DNS/certificate authority; replace :8080
# with a real hostname to get Caddy's automatic HTTPS instead, matching
# Caddyfile.central.example.

:8080 {
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8000
}
